{"id":842336,"title":"19｜设计插件功能和布局","content":"本节课介绍如何开发一个Chrome插件，该插件具备两个主要功能：一是选中页面内容后进行翻译，二是点击按钮总结页面内容。这两个功能都将基于Kimi大模型实现。首先，创建需求文档，明确插件需使用Kimi API，并在侧边栏展示界面。若不指定侧边栏，生成的代码可能为弹出窗口，影响用户体验。接着，通过Composer工具生成UI示意图，包括侧边栏主界面、功能切换按钮及显示区域。此外，可根据个人喜好调整界面名称和配色方案。下节课将进入实际编码阶段。","comments":[{"had_liked":false,"id":400584,"user_name":"Geek_315f91","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":4105781,"ip_address":"江苏","ucode":"8D20F10615126B","user_header":"https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/CriatxianvWV11V39S46s6s0vzzuekzFPuCTib2heagQUaZcQgAuaEfp4pPbXjIq1qTCBPUU3VFL9FLTGb2IbYBbZEMJSlzJChLhVtqM4AENicI/132","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1748399632,"is_pvip":false,"replies":[{"id":145512,"content":"现在的ask就是composer哈，agent单独拆分出来了","user_name":"作者回复","user_name_real":"编辑","uid":1224950,"ctime":1748415921,"ip_address":"北京","comment_id":400584,"utype":1}],"discussion_count":1,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100855101,"comment_content":"老师，讲解的版本不是最新版本，最新版本没有composer，需要更新下课件了","like_count":0,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":1224950,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/12/b0/f6/eb6a8f61.jpg","nickname":"郭旭","note":"","ucode":"7CC6787BD0F0A9","race_medal":0,"user_type":2,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":661648,"discussion_content":"现在的ask就是composer哈，agent单独拆分出来了","content_length":30,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1748415921,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":true,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"北京","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"{\"reply\":true,\"user_type\":2,\"source\":0}","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]}]}]}